{"corpus":"ccc","number":586,"text_html":"<span>Loin d’avoir été hostile au Temple <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup> où il a donné l’essentiel de son enseignement <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"5\">2</sup>, Jésus a voulu payer l’impôt du Temple en s’associant Pierre <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">3</sup> qu’il venait de poser comme fondement pour son Église à venir <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"7\">4</sup>. Plus encore, il s’est identifié au Temple en se présentant comme la demeure définitive<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§797</sup> de Dieu parmi les hommes <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"8\">5</sup>. C’est pourquoi sa mise à mort corporelle <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"10\">6</sup> annonce la destruction du Temple qui manifestera l’entrée dans un nouvel âge de l’histoire du salut : « L’heure vient où ce n’est ni sur cette montagne ni à Jérusalem que vous adorerez le Père<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§1179</sup> » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"11\">7</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":["797","1179"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Mt 8:4"},{"text":"Mt 23:21"},{"text":"Lc 17:14"},{"text":"Jn 4:22"},{"text":"Jn 18:20"},{"text":"Mt 17:24-27"},{"text":"Mt 16:18"},{"text":"Jn 2:21"},{"text":"Mt 12:6"},{"text":"Jn 2:18-22"},{"text":"Jn 4:21"},{"text":"Jn 4:23-24"},{"text":"Mt 27:51"},{"text":"He 9:11"},{"text":"Ap 21:22"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 8:4","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"23:21","idx":2,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 17:14","idx":3,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Jn 4:22","idx":4,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 18:20","idx":5,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 17:24-27","idx":6,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 16:18","idx":7,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 2:21","idx":8,"display_idx":5},{"type":"bible","raw":"Mt 12:6","idx":9,"marker_idx":8,"display_idx":5},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 2:18-22","idx":10,"display_idx":6},{"type":"bible","raw":"Jn 4:21","idx":11,"display_idx":7},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 4:23-24","idx":12,"marker_idx":11,"display_idx":7},{"type":"bible","raw":"Mt 27:51","idx":13,"marker_idx":11,"display_idx":7},{"type":"bible","raw":"He 9:11","idx":14,"marker_idx":11,"display_idx":7},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ap 21:22","idx":15,"marker_idx":11,"display_idx":7}]}